!Pso'Xja Composite Map.png|right|Pso'Xja Composite Map
[Useful Items to bring:
* {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165}
* {@i:Prism Powder|4164} {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164}

