* Speak with {n:Monberaux} in {z:Upper Jeuno} at the Infirmary (G-10).
** Near Homepoint #3
** (__Optional__) Speak with {n:Migliorozz} in {z:Upper Jeuno} next door at the Temple of the Goddess (H-9) to begin the sidequest {q:A Reputation in Ruins|A Reputation in Ruins|A Reputation in Ruins}. The fame requirement is unknown and the recommended level for it 60+.
*** The content and cutscenes of this sidequest change after this mission is completed. There is no way to replay the alternate cutscenes, so complete the quest during the next steps if you wish to see them.
* Speak to {n:Ghebi Damomohe} inside __Neptune's Spire__ of {z:Lower Jeuno}.
* Everyone in your party (or if solo, you) must obtain a {@k}{k:Pso'Xja pass}.
** Obtained along with 500 gil by trading {n:Ghebi Damomohe} any of the colored chips ({@i:Gray Chip|1694} {@i:Cyan Chip|1693} {@i:Carmine Chip|1692}). It doesn't matter which color. Each participating player will need one to get the pass.
*** To obtain colored chips: Head to {z:Pso'Xja} via one of the uncapped level entrances in {z:Beaucedine Glacier}. (see the following, and also the table below)
**** **Update:** {z:Pso'Xja} is no longer level capped. The easiest place to farm is the entrance at (H-8), Other's are at (I-7), (F-7), and (G-9).
***** Nue Entrance (F-7) is by far the best place to farm.
**** Defeat all monsters until everyone (or if solo, you) has any of the colored chips ({@i:Gray Chip|1694} {@i:Cyan Chip|1693} {@i:Carmine Chip|1692}). It doesn't matter which color, as long as everyone has atleast one.
***** It is easiest to fight {p:Diremite} which drop {@i:Gray Chip|1694} {i:Gray Chip|Gray Chip|1694} in the first room from the (H-8) entrance.
****** The {p:Survival Guide} warp to Beaucedine is the closest point to (H-8).
**** The uncapped entrance at (G-9) is the destination for {q:A Reputation in Ruins|A Reputation in Ruins|A Reputation in Ruins}, where you'll find {m:Treasure Chest (Monster)s|Treasure Chest (Monster)} (aka Mimics) which have a very high drop rate on {@i:Cyan Chip|1693} {i:Cyan Chip|Cyan Chip|1693}.
***** It's possible to get this chip through the quest for {n:Migliorozz} when you drop down after the first blue door.
****** **Note: Was able to get the mimics to drop the chip without the quest. @Sept 2025**
